src/index.ts file kholo. Usme kuch default code hoga. Usse replace karo ya uske neeche add karo:

  import { Hono } from 'hono'

  const app = new Hono()

  app.get('/', (c) => {
    return c.json({ message: 'Backend chal raha hai!' })
  })

  app.get('/api/hello', (c) => {
    return c.json({ greeting: 'Namaste duniya!' })
  })

  export default app

Ye kya kar raha hai:
  • Jab koi tumhare backend ka main URL khole → "Backend chal raha hai!" dikhega
  • Jab koi /api/hello pe jaaye → "Namaste duniya!" dikhega

Local test karne ke liye terminal mein:

  npm run dev

Browser mein http://localhost:8787 kholo — response dikhna chahiye.
